Word default values
-------------------

A new document is built to look like Word's blank one (decision 0011). The
XML in lib/src/docx/blank_document.dart, default_styles.dart and
builtin_numbering.dart is written by this project. Its values (fonts, sizes,
spacing, colours, list formats) follow the defaults of Microsoft Word for
Mac 16.114. The one constant kept from a Word file is word/document.xml's
root and section (blankDocument): a list of namespaces and the page's
values. Word files saved by the owner are kept under
test/fixtures/owner/docx/ as test input only.
